207
00:11:09,968 --> 00:11:11,008
Slash BTW.

208
00:11:11,214 --> 00:11:11,728
C tier.

209
00:11:11,888 --> 00:11:13,648
Probably won't use this much, but it's nice to have.

210
00:11:13,838 --> 00:11:18,288
It lets you ask a question mid-task and it doesn't interrupt Claude or touch the conversation history.

211
00:11:18,478 --> 00:11:21,568
So you can ask about stuff Claude has already read or implemented.

212
00:11:21,742 --> 00:11:26,688
When you run this command, Claude can't read files or use any commands, it just uses the conversation history.

213
00:11:26,768 --> 00:11:31,172
But it's really nice to have if you have a question about something and want to know why it's making these decisions.

214
00:11:32,368 --> 00:11:34,208
I mentioned you can use Claude in different ways.

215
00:11:34,446 --> 00:11:37,508
Slash teleport and remote control lets you move sessions between these apps.

216
00:11:37,678 --> 00:11:48,848
